# The SVG icons need a plugin the libraries don't pull in; sound goes through PulseAudio or PipeWire,
# and Qt's own translations give the standard buttons, like OK and Cancel, their German.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, qt6-svg-plugins
Recommends: pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio, qt6-translations-l10n
Description: Intercom for Kiosk Satellite kiosks and phones
 The Intercom Satellite Desktop App turns a Linux computer into an intercom
 for Kiosk Satellite kiosks. It also works with the Intercom Satellite app on
 Android phones: calls, video calls and announcements on the local network,
 optionally encrypted with TLS.
